      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to a doctor but i cant get an appointment until next week and the pain is making it impossible to focus on work or even sleep. is there a specific reason ibuprofen is bad? i thought it was just a standard painkiller and it's usually fine for everyone else.",
